# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build context allowlist.
#
# The repo carries ~17 GB (data/ alone is 15 GB of HCP netmats plus 1.2 GB of
# PLINK outputs). Exclude everything, then re-admit only what the image needs.
# Resulting context: ~2 MB.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*

!code/
!docker/

# ...minus junk inside code/
code/.snakemake/
code/__pycache__/
code/utils/__pycache__/
# code/.git is a `gitdir:` FILE pointing at a worktree outside this repo;
# excluding it keeps a broken git pointer out of the image.
code/.git
code/*.log
code/snakemake.log

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
